hp-gnome-theme
==============

Trademarks
  HP and the HP logo are trademarks of HP Inc. This project is unofficial and is
  not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by HP Inc. It contains colour
  values only; no HP logos, fonts or wallpapers are bundled or installed.

Yaru
  gdm/gdm.sh builds the login screen theme on the user's machine from the
  installed Yaru GNOME Shell theme (https://github.com/ubuntu/yaru, GPL-3.0 /
  CC-BY-SA-4.0), appending gdm/hp-gdm.css. The resulting file is a
  derivative of Yaru and is covered by Yaru's licence. No Yaru files are
  distributed in this repository.

Plymouth
  plymouth/plymouth.sh copies the spinner images from the installed Plymouth
  "spinner" theme (GPL-2.0-or-later) into the generated theme directory at
  install time. No Plymouth files are distributed in this repository.

Fonts
  HP Forma DJR Office is a proprietary typeface and is not included. Forma DJT
  is a free typeface available for download online; check its licence before use.
  Montserrat (SIL Open Font License) is installed from the distribution's
  packages when requested.
